b7Tk5P3tv\nADx7vGjI47SyprS3BOiVk+JRHHXdykjQIrZrdAT9kEDamsdm5wr9y4TX4xHD/aLn\nsdR3ANbMEq1SCcb4GZKnGIMNEKNqNUPB6f/p9VXPARBAf89pqDce7WcvOLdfBzXo\n+WcydkIxWawZXZCC249/OFdHVnkZBhDtcjBfOnjv6M007BiogB63bcItJloB+aZ5\nzQIkwJJH6RFdM1WOiBgMf4qAHggfDFRYI1ZF8vJVlIFLjfsE8LsyqGZ9yXg2UXlH\nJR9eN6xuRA/4MHQBze50a1B/ggbim82n+cI0tVEqnGJiqQNFrDDibZiA0dtgAr7W\nkK787cnDm0C0RPY0He7VZnH+CSUQlmOxue/7pRkAvMLAx+E7a6eE/7yflA5pCXN0\nOL1qYDNJquQfMPwDhrJKiu2n7RRkiwQjDRerk2DZvr1cfjvgeLydi73OqOOzudKn\nn0GH927+omr4YKPBZL1IMrMeBKY2qytWfZUFuiAeo1+58aSgeyKpq3Lre3FE+55g\nc2nTcq8yDRsNc12q4sYRpoTnqAU390gC6XoHhAWq9DIgLkoijpGcCy0ADchjlQhW\nZm4Xtmbk6Dhhl2MsQD9j\n=f+qY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 2cb2ccfea16bf39fd94ced64b8da85aa48c2edf3\nparent 96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218\nauthor jif <jif@openai.com> 1780498054 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780498054 +0200\n\nfix: main (#26176)","verified_at":"2026-06-03T14:47:37Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/4417e4c193bf40e721c5bdf254b86904e3916b72","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/4417e4c193bf40e721c5bdf254b86904e3916b72","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/4417e4c193bf40e721c5bdf254b86904e3916b72/comments","author":{"login":"jif-oai","id":230027070,"node_id":"U_kgDODbXvPg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230027070?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/jif-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218"}]},{"sha":"96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKDk2ZDJkMmY2OGMwN2VmMDE2NTBkYjFjYmEwMTA3MWZiYjJkOTgyMTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"jif","email":"jif@openai.com","date":"2026-06-03T14:24:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-03T14:24:16Z"},"message":"Implement v1 skills extension prompt injection (#26167)\n\n## Why\n\nThe skills extension needs a real turn-time path before host, executor,\nor remote skills can be routed through it. The previous code was mostly\na placeholder catalog/provider sketch, so there was no bounded\navailable-skills fragment, no source-owned `SKILL.md` read, and no place\nfor warnings or per-turn selection state to live.\n\nThis PR makes `ext/skills` the authority-preserving flow for listing\ncandidate skills and injecting only explicitly selected main prompts,\nwithout adding more of that logic to `codex-core`.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Expands catalog entries with `main_prompt`, display path, short\ndescription, dependency metadata, enabled/prompt visibility flags, and\nauthority/package-aware read requests.\n- Replaces the placeholder `providers/*` modules with\n`SkillProviderSource` and `SkillProviders`, routing list/read/search\ncalls by source kind and surfacing provider failures as warnings.\n- Adds bounded available-skills rendering and `SKILL.md` main-prompt\ntruncation before the fragments enter model context.\n- Resolves explicit skill selections from structured `UserInput::Skill`,\nskill-file mentions, `skill://...` paths, and plain `$skill` text\nmentions, then reads selected prompts through their owning provider.\n- Stores mutable per-thread skills config and per-turn\ncatalog/selection/warning state.\n- Adds `install_with_providers` so tests and future host wiring can\nsupply concrete providers.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Not run locally.\n- Added `codex-rs/ext/skills/tests/skills_extension.rs` coverage for\navailable-catalog injection, selected prompt injection through the\nowning provider, and prompt-hidden skills that remain invokable.","tree":{"sha":"e3be6488348d7aa3b1d0d91e3139abfe0a2a71f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/e3be6488348d7aa3b1d0d91e3139abfe0a2a71f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIDkQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANz0QACb/F2Rl772dF/hs8q45d28I\nIYtptju5oaaJDOpYE9al/SyVIBKi6u6zOZvXRdO0RAsJCW2dOErd1bMXz7gCaj0A\nEC6wXGgUTL/MlkAdMqAqxvRVEOkKqbBjBzIvYAPZDb03hP/0w9m9dYtem7lQnjtH\nm7/e6ju8Zk1oqZWdHIwwMsUxp4GPMu+SILgI/j9+mKLsGTHIx6bIE/cym3MRtQV0\nS7Q1dzP4TjcxR4WSL/l4vFAoM6xJ5BnUE8CCJFmlWWMjW7AD9LN7eQy1B+206jLY\ndx80PbM9fArAFUd/nnqCKd+oVN5PScCcgWpSFptF4jzKat3j6D9yclk6AXPmExKc\n9sWC3yQLetUvl3404CN7d0r7vXUfkabCnsJFWa09kU9GsNi9xb9TnPrqS6F16Y7q\n65flJYY5mA81AJzhdWhZzUrJPABPpaez01tnaPH6UE3CyYnm/Orp6vwQ0T7vy2L4\noLP+geQz4zD5PzlbvPrsbdxJEQMOEJZZXJ2T0pPXq7rxrauogMqYEt0lBLt8uJqX\nAFW7JDgT99S/poOCOImR/JyQfxr+qBf+lZQU9OTA5E5Rqzp+UI3Fhh/pypT8vOYW\nyeDcfrcBRryA63pYbzH5AxwE5D6uqERd9E19CJAaTrUmkQ6qbTfNDkt4/Zg7Ezqt\nxvwO3roGGspjnqYBlfJ+\n=fwWv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e3be6488348d7aa3b1d0d91e3139abfe0a2a71f2\nparent c9ae0f48a13022191285d998bf10234ccf20313a\nauthor jif <jif@openai.com> 1780496656 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780496656 +0200\n\nImplement v1 skills extension prompt injection (#26167)\n\n## Why\n\nThe skills extension needs a real turn-time path before host, executor,\nor remote skills can be routed through it. The previous code was mostly\na placeholder catalog/provider sketch, so there was no bounded\navailable-skills fragment, no source-owned `SKILL.md` read, and no place\nfor warnings or per-turn selection state to live.\n\nThis PR makes `ext/skills` the authority-preserving flow for listing\ncandidate skills and injecting only explicitly selected main prompts,\nwithout adding more of that logic to `codex-core`.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Expands catalog entries with `main_prompt`, display path, short\ndescription, dependency metadata, enabled/prompt visibility flags, and\nauthority/package-aware read requests.\n- Replaces the placeholder `providers/*` modules with\n`SkillProviderSource` and `SkillProviders`, routing list/read/search\ncalls by source kind and surfacing provider failures as warnings.\n- Adds bounded available-skills rendering and `SKILL.md` main-prompt\ntruncation before the fragments enter model context.\n- Resolves explicit skill selections from structured `UserInput::Skill`,\nskill-file mentions, `skill://...` paths, and plain `$skill` text\nmentions, then reads selected prompts through their owning provider.\n- Stores mutable per-thread skills config and per-turn\ncatalog/selection/warning state.\n- Adds `install_with_providers` so tests and future host wiring can\nsupply concrete providers.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Not run locally.\n- Added `codex-rs/ext/skills/tests/skills_extension.rs` coverage for\navailable-catalog injection, selected prompt injection through the\nowning provider, and prompt-hidden skills that remain invokable.","verified_at":"2026-06-03T14:24:24Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/96d2d2f68c07ef01650db1cba01071fbb2d98218/comments","author":{"login":"jif-oai","id":230027070,"node_id":"U_kgDODbXvPg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230027070?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/jif-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c9ae0f48a13022191285d998bf10234ccf20313a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/c9ae0f48a13022191285d998bf10234ccf20313a","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/c9ae0f48a13022191285d998bf10234ccf20313a"}]}]